      "text": "AI team, projects module. Reference status-report layout in the app's own tokens \u2014 Archivo, electric palette, 20px panels, the .micro/.fig ramp. Dark shown; light inverts through the same tokens.\n\nBuilt: the dials, the milestone Gantt, the plain-word labels."
