      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 600,
      "text": "Presales report, rebuilt. Same spine as the project reports: a headline read first, the figures as a shape rather than a list, what is stuck given its own tinted block, then the work.\n\nThe funnel, the day-by-day bars, the win rate and the pipeline are new \u2014 they need figures the template does not ask for yet."
